Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "StorageLocation": "1710",
    "Material": "30007R",
    "Quantity": 1.0,
    "SpecialStockNumber": "0000200604",
    "SourceType": "RO",
    "SourceBin": "CANOPY",
    "DestinationType": "SA",
    "DestinationBin": "PTFE",
    "Header": "Consignment"
}
###


### POST /api/warehouse/consignment-mb1b  (TESTRUN — MB1B leg only, via
### BAPI_GOODSMVT_CREATE GM_CODE "04". GM_CODE "04" is UNTESTED against this
### SAP system — "01" (GoodsReceiptHelper, movement 101) was confirmed
### broken here, "06" (StockAdjustmentHelper, movement 711) was confirmed
### working. Run this TESTRUN call first; if it comes back with a sensible
### RETURN message instead of a generic RFC failure, "04" is at least
### reachable and validating input. Only then try a real posting below on a
### throwaway material/vendor/quantity — a real TESTRUN=false call here also
### fires the two LT01 legs for real.)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/warehouse/consignment-mb1b
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "StorageLocation": "1710",
    "Material": "30007R",
    "Quantity": 1.0,
    "SpecialStockNumber": "0000200604",
    "SourceType": "RO",
    "SourceBin": "CANOPY",
    "DestinationType": "SA",
    "DestinationBin": "PTFE",
    "Header": "Consignment",
    "TestRun": true
}
###


